  <!--
    ScoutScope inspection profile — IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3 free core.
    Scope: every APPLICABLE general JavaScript / HTML / CSS inspection the
    free core offers for a dependency-free static web app (verified against
    the IDE's own inspection catalog, inspections/out/.descriptions.xml,
    115 JS/HTML/CSS short names on 2026-11-20).
    Deliberately NOT enabled, with reasons:
    - Framework-specific (Angular*, JSX*, JSJQueryEfficiency): this project
      uses vanilla JS + plain HTML/CSS; those inspections cannot apply.
    - Pure style conversions (JSFunctionExpressionToArrowFunction,
      JSRemoveUnnecessaryParentheses, JSArrowFunctionBracesCanBeRemoved,
      CssReplaceWithShorthand*, CssConvertColorTo*): suggestions, not
      defects — they would flood the report with noise.
    - SpellCheckingInspection: typo noise on VALORANT/agent terminology.
    - JSHint: needs a separate .jshintrc config; not part of the IDE core.
